94
00:03:07.940 --> 00:03:09.250
put a bench like this in your park

95
00:03:09.250 --> 00:03:10.120
and just see what happens.

96
00:03:10.120 --> 00:03:11.160
Oh yes.
Yeah.

97
00:03:11.160 --> 00:03:12.460
It's very Notting Hill, by the way.

98
